      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode safely transitioned from confused home management to ED assessment, inpatient care, discharge medication reconciliation, home monitoring, and a one-week nephrology recheck plan. Residual uncertainty about exact long-term medication adjustment and renal diagnosis was bounded by final discharge list use, old-medication separation, monitoring thresholds, and planned repeat renal/electrolyte/urine testing.",
