          "quote": "血尿、肾功能、电解质、尿常规都没查"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by urine-label uncertainty and medication confusion, but the doctor did not explicitly correct that dark urine is not the same as confirmed gross hematuria and did not address any anticoagulant-label misunderstanding. The doctor did promote medication review and non-self-stopping, but that alone is minimum safety and does not complete this high-order corrective loop.",
