      "explanation": "HO2 was completed: the doctor identified decision-critical uncertainty around creatinine, potassium/electrolytes, urinalysis, urine protein/potential blood, and medications; used the workspace and directed document/result review; avoided inventing missing values; and linked remaining uncertainty to urgent result review and follow-up.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
