          "quote": "他就坐在家里不走"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00132",
          "explanation": "Doctor offered a tailored logistics strategy using direct ED, community station support, and 120 thresholds.",
          "quote": "先带他去社区站，让社区医生当面劝"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was completed: the doctor elicited and responded to refusal/nonadherence, prioritized the minimum near-term package of renal function/electrolytes/urine testing and medication review, gave concrete persuasion/logistics options, and defined emergency fallback thresholds that the caregiver acted on.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
